== casting 11 / AC-022, AC-031, AC-048, NFR-011: the untouchable prose modules ==

  WHAT THIS SELECTION REACHES, AND WHAT IT CLAIMS. The claim is the
  additive rule this casting builds under: the two prose modules that
  quote sentences out of agents/assayer.md and the four skills stay green
  while this casting edits that prose. Two of the three modules are
  therefore peer-owned BY CONSTRUCTION -- tests/test_protocol_prose.py
  belongs to casting 6 (719 passed, 4 skipped) and tests/test_lead_prose.py
  to casting 8 (258 passed) -- and only tests/test_skill_prose.py (113
  passed, 9 skipped) belongs to this casting. A log whose claim IS that it
  runs the module of someone else cannot be made self-owned; it can only
  be made to stop counting them.

  WHY A VERDICT AND NOT A COUNT. Committed reading 1089 passed, this log
  read 1090 at 3c01399. Governing ruling and the two rejected repairs:
  evidence/casting-1-no-degradation.log. Scope unchanged -- all three
  modules, the same flags.

  THE PASSED FLOOR. 900, because losing either peer module lands below it:
  1090 less test_protocol_prose.py 719 is 371, and less
  test_lead_prose.py 258 is 832.

  AND THE SKIP FLOOR, WHICH IS NOT DECORATION. The 13 skips split by owner
  too: 9 are in the module of this casting, where _spec_presence_or_skip
  fires because the gate re-executes in a detached worktree and
  forge-specs/ is gitignored, and 4 are the target_kind skips of casting 6.
  The floor is 9 rather than an exact 13 for the ordinary reason -- it is
  met whenever the nine of this casting are present and is indifferent to
  whether the four of casting 6 are. It earns its place because the
  collapse it catches is invisible to the passed floor above: deleting all
  nine skipping nodes leaves passed at 1090 and reports MET, and so does
  the whole module of this casting falling out of the selection (1090 less
  113 is 977, still above 900). A skipped node contributes nothing to
  passed, so only a skip floor can watch these nine go.

VERDICT: PASS -- exit 0, both peer prose modules green beside this castings own, collected floor >= 900 met and the run-spec-absent skip floor >= 9 held
